**Expertise**: Vectorized backtesting (NumPy, Pandas), low-latency C++ (lock-free queues, memory pools), Python/C++ integration (pybind11), DLT market microstructure (Hyperliquid, perpetual futures), orderbook simulation, distributed systems, performance optimization.

